## Previous Work & Reference Files

This directory contains backup files and selected components from previous
development work. These files are retained as reference material and may be
reused during the development of the current NPU project.

Some of the material originates from an earlier **8×8 TPU project** and
contains previous implementations, experiments, RTL modules, design ideas,
and supporting documentation.

These files are **not necessarily part of the current implementation**.
They are maintained as a reference library and may be integrated, modified,
or discarded depending on the requirements of the current architecture.

### Purpose

The backup material is maintained for:

- Reusing previously developed RTL modules and design blocks
- Referencing earlier microarchitectural decisions
- Comparing previous and current implementations
- Reusing verification and simulation components where applicable
- Studying previous design approaches and optimizations
- Preserving useful experimental work from the earlier 8×8 TPU project

### Important Note

Files in this directory should be considered **reference/backup material**,
not confirmed components of the current NPU design.
